OL,3,GNEWSAI've waited four months to bury my
OL,4,Ason after delay in returning brain
OL,5,
OL,6,FA grieving mother has said she has been
OL,7,Fwaiting for over four months to bury
OL,8,Fher son after delays to post-mortem
OL,9,Ftests on his brain.
OL,11,FPhil Malone, 39, died at the Queen's
OL,12,FMedical Centre (QMC) in Nottingham on 8
OL,13,FJune, five weeks after suffering a
OL,14,Fbleed on the brain. The organ was
OL,15,Fremoved after the coroner asked for
OL,16,Ftests to determine a cause of death.
OL,18,FLyn Malone, who lives in Melton
OL,19,FMowbray, Leicestershire, said she was
OL,20,Finitially told it would take 10 weeks,
OL,21,Fbut 16 weeks after his death she had
OL,22,Fstill not been able to bury him.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
